<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <PackageType>Template</PackageType>
    <PackageId>GPreviatti.Template.Hexagonal.Solution</PackageId>
    <Title>Hexagonal architecture solution template</Title>
    <Authors>Giovanni Brunno Previatti</Authors>
    <Description>Solution following Hexagonal architecture and best practices.</Description>
    <PackageTags>template;hexagonal-architecture;clean-architecture;ddd;blazor;webui;net10</PackageTags>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <IncludeContentInPack>true</IncludeContentInPack>
    <IncludeBuildOutput>false</IncludeBuildOutput>
    <ContentTargetFolders>content</ContentTargetFolders>
    <NoWarn>$(NoWarn);NU5128</NoWarn>
    <NoDefaultExcludes>true</NoDefaultExcludes>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/gpreviatti/hexagonal-solution-template</PackageProjectUrl>
    <PackageReadmeFile>Readme.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <RepositoryUrl>git://github.com/gpreviatti/hexagonal-solution-template</RepositoryUrl>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
    - Upgrade NuGet packages across all templates (Bff, Contracts, Full, Simple, SimpleWebUi, WebUi) using dotnet outdated.
    - Major upgrades: Meziantou.Analyzer 3.0.303, Roslynator.Analyzers 5.0.1, xunit.analyzers 2.2.0, xunit.runner.visualstudio 4.0.1.
    - Upgrade OpenTelemetry packages to 1.19, Microsoft.Extensions.Caching.Hybrid to 10.11.0, Grpc.AspNetCore to 2.84.0, and EF Core and Microsoft.Extensions to 10.0.13.
    - Upgrade SonarAnalyzer.CSharp to 10.35, Moq to 4.21.0, and Playwright to 1.63.0 (WebUi templates).
    - Pin transitive packages (for example OpenTelemetry.Api, AngleSharp) to resolve restore downgrade errors.
    - Fix analyzer findings and Moq 4.21 nullability warnings in the template code and unit tests.
    - Fix a deadlocked unit test in the SimpleWebUi CreateOrder page tests.
    </PackageReleaseNotes>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <Content Include="templates\**\*" Exclude="templates\**\bin\**;templates\**\obj\**" />
    <Compile Remove="**\*" />
    <None Include="Readme.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>